<title>CHINA: Shanghai Hero plans bonus issue, cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Hero plans bonus issue, cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Hero Co Ltd said it plans to allocate its 1996 profits to shareholders in the form of a 1.5-for-10 bonus issue and cash dividend of one yuan per share.</p>
<p>The plan needs the approval of shareholders, the company said in a statement published in Shanghai Securities News on Sunday.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
<p>The company's annual report, published in the same newspaper, showed 1996 net profit at 45.044 million yuan ($5.42 million), against 1995's 44.754 million yuan, according to international accounting standards.</p>
<p>($1=8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Shanghai newsroom (86-21) 2843-7004</p>
</text>
